Kvmd errors, timeouts, and retry
---------------------------------

Typed HTTP failure (a status on the error) and one retry of
GET /streamer/snapshot after HTTP 503 are adapted from
dvaerum/pikvm_mcp_server src/pikvm/client.ts PiKVMApiError and
fetchSnapshotWithRetry at b5fdc31e16525f196282436a0fa7ca797eea2e5e
(GPL-3.0). The grace period is 1500 ms. This fork does not take the
websocket keepalive from that commit.

AbortSignal.timeout, PIKVM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS (default 5000), and the
no-retry codes PIKVM_UNREACHABLE and PIKVM_AUTH_FAILED are adapted from
dtrukr/pikvm_mcp_server src/pikvm/client.ts and src/config.ts at
d120243c4b81802ae725c18b39c4681ce89bfb7a (GPL-3.0). A timeout is reported
as PIKVM_TIMEOUT. Idempotent GET retry is local to this fork: 3
attempts, sleeping 250 ms then 500 ms plus jitter (the 250/500/1000 ms
schedule; the 1000 ms step sits outside the three-attempt cap), on
network errors, timeouts, HTTP 502, and HTTP 503. POST is not retried.
HTTP 400, 401, 403, and 409 are not retried.

